{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0663_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8c9d2dad8a53600a012b2e3fa2fffb65c561644ebc7afdf537a4bdd8cbd401cb", "ja": "（アイドルの肝試し企画の参考に、\n人気のお化け屋敷へ行くことにしたのだが……）", "zh": "（本来是想去人气鬼屋，为偶像们的试胆企划取材，\n可没想到……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0663_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fe1ec753c8154b9feb7b12a9b614e8bf4d91aaa291118eab028188cd172aee5f", "ja": "うわ～……入口から、本格的ですね。\n思ったより雰囲気があって怖そう……。", "zh": "哇～……从入口开始就很逼真呢。\n比想象中更有那种氛围，感觉好吓人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0663_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f44cdfad547fd21642b014caa7de5087f66b44abf1bafe2fdfe433a4876d11d3", "ja": "ああ。並んでる人の数もすごいな。……って、\nまさか翼も一緒に来てくれるとは思わなかったよ。", "zh": "嗯，排队的人数也真不少啊。……等等，没想到翼你也会一起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0663_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e3a73ad969c2ce5a9a5ebd44f7713080bc2efe12229fd63f09b75633ea0d9ca8", "ja": "だって、{$P$}さんと\nデートできるチャンスだと思ったんだもん！", "zh": "因为我觉得这是个能和{$P$}先生约会的机会嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0663_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "22af83fa9889bcdde76fbfa4c1e24a0cb1527ac9f03a5479ac9732e2973c1fa6", "ja": "オバケ屋敷って、鉄板のデートスポットじゃない\nですか。だから絶対、一緒に来たいな～って！", "zh": "鬼屋不是经典的约会地点吗？所以我就想着，无论如何都想和你一起来嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0663_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d566ca15c1ff2984025b43d39ccd4ca9c617a098cc1264ce60abe3424d77064e", "ja": "遊びに来たんじゃなくて、あくまで仕事の参考に……\nなんて話してたら、もうすぐ順番だな。", "zh": "不是来玩的，只是单纯来参考工作……正说着这些，我们马上就要轮到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0663_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "85487b73a70f43ebffb7572d332d81fa49c909160d29bc656efd9c37612d7fb6", "ja": "……！　そ、そうですね！\nううっ、何だか緊張してきちゃった……。", "zh": "……！　是、是的呢！\n呜呜，不知怎么突然紧张起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0663_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4d77f0cc8dc3d1e36ba7fd27fa93c04c1a6b0247c8af3cc902965b8d1de80d7a", "ja": "大丈夫か、翼？\nまだ入る前だし、リタイアするなら間に合うぞ。", "zh": "没问题吧，翼？\n现在还没进去，要是想放弃还来得及哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0663_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e594d57bb9e65f22036664880b726acd0d6aff256e7115702b0fe6d882b1b7e2", "ja": "えっ？　どうしよう……。結構怖そうだし……でも、\n{$P$}さんとデートはしたいし……。", "zh": "咦？怎么办……看起来好像挺可怕的……可是，\n我还是想和{$P$}先生约会……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0663_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "44495ca129044b8bc0763fe82a324061c0da805892e9a943b2eed50d2b4adbee", "ja": "{$P$}さん？　もしオバケが\n襲ってきたら、わたしのこと守ってくれる？", "zh": "{$P$}先生？要是有鬼袭击过来，你会保护我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0663_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c2c95fd8a74253a3801aadbefd61ebd363d26b157ae8d2748215c07c1da6f6f1", "ja": "もちろん。ただ、俺もちょっと怖くてね……。\nでも、翼を守れるように頑張るよ。", "zh": "当然。不过我其实也有点害怕……  \n但我会努力保护好翼的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0663_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "36a1ea1d16b8d5006a28617b483d113e286f6c95e4a8db2c8c31a06a1e2ec159", "ja": "本当～！？　じゃあ……えいっ！", "zh": "真的～！？　那就……嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0663_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3444353642b38869b41554f65bd0073a5e80ec98664e3aac4a3a6a27428ab460", "ja": "つ、翼？　腕につかまって、どうした？", "zh": "翼？　抓住我的胳膊，这是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0663_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9c2507cc9fcc0c98a6ecd56ce5be504de9445e93d619ded8fd0f6ac88af513f3", "ja": "えへへ♪　{$P$}さん、言ったじゃ\nないですか～。わたしのこと守ってくれるって。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪{$P$}先生，您不是说过吗～会保护我的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0663_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a2d013aeae58efa8acbe6ffa01f265f4804557201b7b3bfeabce8f0becda6c86", "ja": "わたし、こうしてくっついてたら、\nすっごく安心できるんです。……ダメぇ～？", "zh": "我像这样贴着您，就会特别有安全感。……不行嘛～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0663_1015_p", "source_sha256": "77ac915569c6a81f8311dc8964e98d3a27c786ffcfc73761f93f62757e409c66", "ja": "そういう意味じゃなかったんだが……。\nまあ、仕方ない。お化け屋敷に入ってる間だけだぞ？", "zh": "我不是这个意思……不过，也没办法。只能在鬼屋里待着的时候这样哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0663_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0663_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1fa807a6e3db287cd45376fab14d06543bbdb40720901680931a552d93f6d0a3", "ja": "は～い！　{$P$}さん、\n素敵な思い出作りましょうね。えへへ♪", "zh": "好——！{$P$}先生，我们一起创造美好的回忆吧。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
